{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊，没什么没什么！这风车真可爱，比小镇上的都好看呢，{myName}你真厉害呀——[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我本来是想这么说的来着……哈哈……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]其实……我是突然想到了这辆货车的事。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]那个商人是这么说的吧？因为异变，各种货物都在减产，而我们装车的物资能帮助驿站里的人们……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我以往是饿了才出去狩猎，偶尔储上一些肉食，就算是你来了之后，营地里这些物资也都是野外一时兴起采集的，这么多天也才储备了这么些东西。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]但这货车这么大，运个两天我们恐怕就没存货了呀。就算报酬再丰厚，真的能像那个商人说的一样，帮上大家的忙吗……[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_25","text":"没想到米托拉会这么认真地考虑这件事啊……"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show][cm]你什么意思啦！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_16","text":"不如我们趁空闲时做些日常计划吧。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]日常……计划？只要每天坚持做些准备，积少成多，效率就会比现在这样随性而为高得多？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]真的会是这样吗？说得我都有些心动了！不然，你先做个示范给我看看吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"日常计划行动引导","script":"m_1_5_5"}